# LexaSafe — Creative Dev (enforce)

## Brand (do not regress)
- Palette only: `#FBF8F4` / `#84AFFB` / `#0259DD` / `#D91A2A`. Navbar + hero titles: Syne.
- No magnetic hover on existing homepage navbar/hero CTAs. Magnetic is allowed ONLY on presentation cards in `HeroRequisition.tsx`.
- `CreatorsSection` stays a Server Component. Do not nest new `"use client"` modules under `HomeShell` (homepage crash risk).
- Do not put DPO email in the footer. Do not set `optimizePackageImports` on workspace packages. Do not make homepage cache immutable `/_next/static`.

## Motion / 3D stack
- Smooth scroll: **Lenis**. `@studio-freight/react-lenis` is deprecated (Studio Freight → darkroom.engineering). Use `lenis/react` (`ReactLenis`, `useLenis`) or `@/lib/react-lenis`. Homepage already uses vanilla `lenis` in `SmoothScroll` — do not double-wrap `/` (breaks navbar scroll-spy). POC routes (`/poc`) may use `ReactLenis`.
- GSAP: **ScrollTrigger only inside `useGSAP()`** (`@gsap/react`). Register plugins in that callback. `useGSAP` reverts context on cleanup (kills tweens + ScrollTriggers). Never leave ScrollTriggers without revert.
- SplitText is Club GSAP (paid) — not in public `gsap`. Split letters in React, animate with GSAP or Framer Motion.
- Framer Motion: micro-interactions only (hover, springs). Prefer `@lexasafe/motion` re-exports; do not add a second Framer copy.
- Three.js / R3F: 3D only. Canvas = client, `next/dynamic` `{ ssr: false }`. Do not mount R3F on the marketing homepage unless HomeShell is proven stable.

## AI secrets
- Gemini / Luma / Meshy keys: server-only (`GEMINI_API_KEY`, `LUMA_API_KEY`, `MESHY_API_KEY`). Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` secrets. Setup page may receive **booleans** (key present), never key values.
